==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From older {{term|lúka|lang=is}}, from {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|lúka|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{recons|lūkaną|lang=gem-pro}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈljuːka/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|uːka|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|lauk|luku|lokið}} (+ {{dative}})

# to [[finish]], to [[end]]
# to [[complete]]
# to [[end]], to [[close]], to come or bring to an end
# [[finalise]]/[[finalize]]
# (of a limited period of time) to [[expire]]
# to [[conclude]]

====Conjugation====
{{is-conj-s2|l|jú|k}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|to finish}} [[enda]], [[binda enda á]]
* {{sense|to complete}} [[klára]]
* {{sense|to end}} [[enda]]
* {{sense|to finalise}} [[ganga frá]]
* {{sense|to expire}} [[renna út]]
* {{sense|to conclude}} [[enda]]

====Related terms====
* {{l|is|lok}}

